## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- Session detection: array of session-start broker hours; parameterise DST offset
- `sess_high`: rolling max of iHigh from session-start bar index down to current bar
- Breakout detect: `High[0] > sess_high_prev_bar` for conservative; `High[0] > High[1]` for aggressive
- Bar-close exit: use OnTick with TimeToClose(TimeLocalToServer(bar_end)) < 30s check, or OnBarClose
- P3 sweeps: conservative vs aggressive, session subset (London+NY vs all four), TP (10/12/15 pips)

